# fbdc36bbf17d20af3fd0447c6d1a8a02773c9844, Lean v4.33.0-rc2, Mathlib 51e6992e) to the pilot's toolchain
# (Lean v4.35.0-rc3, Mathlib 0f64d30a9a4593b3ae50375b960a5cf7f0845606). zeta23 is Copyright 2026 Anthropic, PBC,
# released under the Apache License 2.0; its files under Zeta23/FromPNTPlus/ derive from PrimeNumberTheoremAnd
# (Apache 2.0). build.sh copies zeta23's LICENSE and NOTICE next to the patched files. Applied by build.sh with
# `patch -p1` in upstream/. Files not listed here are used unchanged.
#
# Changes, all forced by Mathlib API drift between the two versions:
# - FromPNTPlus/StrongPNTPrefix: Finset.prod_le_prod → prod_le_prod₀ (renamed).
# - FromPNTPlus/EulerMaclaurin: import Mathlib.MeasureTheory.Function.Floor directly (AbelSummation no longer
#   re-exports it).
# - Analytic/RectangleLogDeriv, RvM/GammaSide: logDeriv_mul → logDeriv_fun_mul (the pointwise form got the new
#   name).
